    <string name="notes_search_hint">Type to search every note. Words match anywhere — body text, headings and file names. `tag:work` keeps only headings carrying that tag, and tags are inherited, so a tag on a parent heading counts for everything under it. Quote a phrase to search for it whole. The bookmark in the field keeps a search to run again from the saved searches.</string>
